ly-mid game potential in campaign clearing and element strong stages, Scarlet: Black Shadow makes auto play and most early-mid CP deficit (20%~) a complete breeze until Commanders hit a certain HP wall for raptures, she then \"falls off\" once heading into very high deficits (30-35+%) due to distributive damage. Assume SSS tier in campaign and combined until then. This should apply to most Commanders</p>", "id": 9}, "tierlist2": null, "recommendations": {"_id": "6a5913e50cf4995042b0dd7b", "name": "Scarlet: Black Shadow", "main": "Bastion Cube", "alternative": "Resilience", "notes": null, "id": 110}, "overloadrecs": {"_id": "6a59149c0cf4995042b0df58", "name": "Scarlet: Black Shadow", "Element Damage Dealt": "6", "Hit Rate": "0", "Max Ammunition Capacity": "1", "ATK": "4", "Charge Damage": "0", "Charge Speed": "1", "Critical Rate": "3", "Critical Damage": "3", "DEF": "0", "Prio": "9", "Notes": null, "id": 101}}